<p style="margin: 0 0 16px;">Use this link to sign in to Firefight.</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">
  <a href="<%= @url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; background: #121312; color: #9ee464; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;">Sign in to Firefight</a>
</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #555555;">It works once, for the next <%= @minutes %> minutes. If you did not ask for it, you can ignore this email and nobody will be signed in.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #888888; font-size: 12px; word-break: break-all;">Or paste this into your browser: <%= @url %></p>
